%% Student State Pipeline — Madar V1
%% Authority: Descriptive. Source of truth: docs/05-runtime/state-pipeline.md
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher
    participant App as Web/API
    participant Ev as Evidence (tenant/enrollment-scoped)
    participant AI as Learning & AI
    participant LLM as LLM (external)

    Teacher->>App: open student's month
    App->>Ev: gather attendance / recitation / quiz evidence
    App->>AI: request State recommendation (async)
    AI->>LLM: via LLM interface
    alt success
        LLM-->>AI: suggested State
        AI-->>App: advisory recommendation
    else fail / timeout
        AI-->>App: no recommendation
        Note over App,Teacher: teacher proceeds manually
    end
    Teacher->>App: finalize State {Good | Needs Follow-up | At Risk}
    App->>Ev: persist finalized State (authoritative)
